  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the project includes building the BC Part of Shorbad village to Shagon village. This part inclides 2 lanes of 7 meters, and rehabilitation of 3 existing bridges, in addition to adjusting few road curves. including all of the road&apos;s attachments, e.g. water</narrative>
